Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.78,0:00:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been five days since the satellite crashed into
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.78,0:00:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Akihabara's Radio Kaikan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.91,0:00:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Since morning, many people have gathered here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,to see it again,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.49,0:00:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,but the satellite's origin remains unknown,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.33,0:00:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and there's no timetable \Nfor when it'll be taken down.
