Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.48,0:02:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.23,0:02:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.19,0:02:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Amane, you've never had a beef bowl?{gyuudon}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.11,0:02:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I've only heard rumors of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.90,0:02:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.32,0:02:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's even better if you put a raw egg on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.16,0:03:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If you call yourself a warrior,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.45,0:03:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,you should be able to come to \Na beef bowl place by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.29,0:03:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Daru and I come here often.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.09,0:03:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If you invite us, we'll go with you anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.92,0:03:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I just remembered!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.55,0:03:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Last time, I had to pay for Okarin's meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.18,0:03:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's possible that happened, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.81,0:03:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not just possible! It happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.52,0:03:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me back my money!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.60,0:03:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sadly, I don't have any on me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.60,0:03:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.15,0:03:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Transfer the funds to my Swiss bank account.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.78,0:03:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.82,0:03:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The Organization hacked into \Nthe Geneva servers?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.07,0:03:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}No cell phones.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.36,0:03:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,How terrible...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.03,0:03:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, he's just pretending.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.79,0:03:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So you were with them too, Suzu?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.21,0:03:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It was time for my lunch break.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.54,0:03:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you came a bit earlier, you could've joined us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.54,0:03:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, do you want to go all together tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.71,0:03:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Okarin would be happy to pay—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.30,0:03:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.22,0:03:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The Organization's sabotaging the process,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.63,0:04:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and it'll take a week to bring the servers back online?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.18,0:04:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kurisu!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.97,0:04:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Assistant, did you get any sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.64,0:04:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't call me "assistant."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.78,0:04:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, part-timer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.28,0:04:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're done with lunch, get back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.91,0:04:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.08,0:04:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,A round table?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.49,0:04:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.04,0:04:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.66,0:04:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A meeting of lab mems.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.92,0:04:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Have we ever had one before?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.71,0:04:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you even own a round table?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.38,0:04:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a physical one,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.46,0:04:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,but the true round table lies \Nwithin all lab mems' hearts,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.47,0:04:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.30,0:04:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether it's true or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.43,0:04:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,don't put anything weird in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.64,0:04:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think there's one in Mayushii's heart too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.48,0:04:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.94,0:04:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.06,0:04:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.69,0:04:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But what's a round table?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.31,0:04:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why a round table?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.11,0:04:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you supposed to be King Arthur?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.36,0:04:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm only a temporary lab mem, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.82,0:05:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,At any rate...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.20,0:05:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,it's time for a round table.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.16,0:05:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to tell Mayuri about the current situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.25,0:05:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.46,0:05:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And so,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.96,0:05:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,in order to defeat SERN, we must perfect
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.59,0:05:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,the PhoneWave (name subject to change)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.22,0:05:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.52,0:05:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is too hard for Mayushii to understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.02,0:05:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just know that SERN is evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.73,0:05:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But how do we perfect it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.32,0:05:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We've succeeded in sending \Nmessages to the past, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.36,0:05:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Only twice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.32,0:05:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And we don't know what conditions
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.07,0:05:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,trigger the phenomenon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.29,0:05:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,From what we observed last time,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.91,0:05:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,it only occurs when there's electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.54,0:05:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.25,0:05:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you figure something out?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.50,0:06:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No, "Emails Sent to the Past" is too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.05,0:06:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,First, we need to find a name for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.80,0:06:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Another failed attempt to sound cool?{changed from "leet"}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.01,0:06:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say "another"!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.14,0:06:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you dare mock the great Hououin...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.14,0:06:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll just give it a stupid name, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.89,0:06:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,How rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.85,0:06:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.23,0:06:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've found the perfect name for the act of sending emails back in time...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.02,0:06:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I call it "Nostalgia Drive"!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.99,0:06:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You write it with the kanji for \N"journey crossing over time,"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.24,0:06:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,but you read it "Nostalgia Drive."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.70,0:06:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Too complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.91,0:06:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Rejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.66,0:06:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're the assistant here! You can't reject—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.13,0:06:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's have a vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.63,0:06:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Who agrees with "Nostalgia Drive"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.05,0:06:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Not you too, Mayuri? Daru?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.76,0:06:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Kurisu is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.51,0:06:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii can't remember a long name like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.01,0:06:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like something invented by a nerdy teenager.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.39,0:06:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We should focus on making it easy to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.23,0:06:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Since it's an email going back in time,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.81,0:06:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,we could call it "Email That Flies Against Time."{Reference to a book. Don't change name.}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.52,0:07:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What does "flies against time" mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.02,0:07:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not easy to understand at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.15,0:07:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It should be "The Email That Leapt Through Time."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.99,0:07:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a bit formal
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.57,0:07:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and hard to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.28,0:07:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't get to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.53,0:07:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Your "Nostalgia Whatsit" was long too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.45,0:07:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's romantic! If it's romantic, it's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.66,0:07:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So we can shorten it to Time-Leap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.58,0:07:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we don't know what leapt through time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.42,0:07:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it an email? A girl? Maybe a banana?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.92,0:07:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii has an idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.93,0:07:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... "Back to the mail"!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.14,0:07:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be going back to the email, \Nnot back in time,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.93,0:07:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,which doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.93,0:07:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then "DeLorean Mail"!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.68,0:07:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes even less sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.14,0:07:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.81,0:07:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we just shorten it to "D-Mail"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.65,0:07:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.94,0:07:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's decided then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.57,0:07:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We will now begin the experiments \Nwith D-Mail (name subject to change).
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.20,0:07:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We can also cut the "(name subject to change)."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.20,0:07:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The operation is called "Operation Urd."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.41,0:07:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need that either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.25,0:07:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But we don't know what it takes to send a D-Mail
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.71,0:08:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,or what it's got to do with electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.92,0:08:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what we're going to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.97,0:08:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Hououin Kyouma, have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.76,0:08:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We forgot the simplest and \Nmost important condition...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.68,0:08:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,which is the time it occurred!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.73,0:08:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The first D-Mail was sent between 12:00 and 13:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.44,0:08:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The second occurred around 18:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.32,0:08:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If we attempt to replicate it at those times,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.61,0:08:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.07,0:08:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.49,0:08:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.87,0:08:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's worth a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.08,0:08:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri, the banana!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.33,0:08:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii's running low on bananas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.37,0:08:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we have to put the banana in?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.29,0:08:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,"Put the banana in"!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru, not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.92,0:08:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see if it turns into jelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.50,0:08:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, assistant,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.84,0:08:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,put the banana inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.80,0:08:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,"Put the banana inside..."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.05,0:08:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough, you pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.10,0:08:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.01,0:08:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll buy you a new banana later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.27,0:08:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.56,0:08:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.10,0:09:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin and Daru never buy me any.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.81,0:09:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez, you two...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.11,0:09:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.11,0:09:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Being clumsy isn't cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.73,0:09:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.53,0:09:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Pain, pain, go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.61,0:09:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mayuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.87,0:09:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop making a Lesbomagnetic{Yuri} Field and prepare the D-Mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.79,0:09:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.79,0:09:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is 120 seconds okay for the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.62,0:09:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.42,0:09:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin Operation Urd!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.84,0:09:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.77,0:09:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.72,0:09:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.31,0:09:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the banana?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.82,0:09:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a gel-bana!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.99,0:09:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I've solved it at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.49,0:09:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,As I thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.57,0:09:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,time was the D-Mail's missing factor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.04,0:09:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice job, Okabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.62,0:10:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize it was so simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.29,0:10:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it bother you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.62,0:10:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I respect you for having the guts to admire me so closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.55,0:10:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, did the D-Mail arrive?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.38,0:10:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.92,0:10:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It says it was sent five days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.34,0:10:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you send two messages, Miss Makise?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.64,0:10:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No, just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.56,0:10:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It was split into two messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.31,0:10:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, what does this message mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.07,0:10:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Look it up yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.36,0:10:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.16,0:10:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,the last D-Mail was also split \Ninto multiple messages,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.87,0:10:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and some of it was lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.33,0:10:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And it went back in time five days too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.37,0:10:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there must be some kinds of rules for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.00,0:10:47.88,Default - margin,,0,0,0,,Which means that D-Mail...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.96,0:10:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,...was calling me an empty-headed idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.38,0:10:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Took you a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.51,0:10:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you, Christina. Taking advantage of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.39,0:10:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute. Why are you buying so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.76,0:11:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The only food we need is \Nnonperishable cup ramen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.60,0:11:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,One bag of the cheap chocolate is plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.39,0:11:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm celebrating our experiment's success.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.40,0:11:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Go put it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.86,0:11:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheap-ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.96,0:11:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.71,0:11:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so happy about the \Nexperiment's success that I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.80,0:11:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We learned SERN's terrifying secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.63,0:11:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And I even got Mayuri involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.76,0:11:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Was this really for the best?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.98,0:11:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Shining Finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.82,0:12:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.25,0:12:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.58,0:12:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have your cell phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.17,0:12:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The great Hououin Kyouma's cell phone is
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.51,0:12:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,currently being used for an experiment that'll be remembered throughout history.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.38,0:12:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.76,0:12:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,O-O-Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.14,0:12:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that sweet-ass...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.01,0:12:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean sexy... 3D girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.89,0:12:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll introduce you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.90,0:12:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Shining Finger, Kiryu Moeka.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.98,0:12:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hi, Kiryu—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.20,0:12:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Even I once had hope for the 3D world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.21,0:12:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.83,0:12:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you guys doing something fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.46,0:12:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.80,0:12:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We're performing an experiment \Nthat'll become legendary—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.05,0:13:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Legendary is fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.84,0:13:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,but the boss is really pissed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.76,0:13:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He says the vibrations from \Nthe second story are really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.43,0:13:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,"I'll raise your rent 10,000 yen!"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.23,0:13:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,he was saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.40,0:13:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,10,000 yen?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.94,0:13:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, leave this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.98,0:13:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell my assistant to stop the \Nexperiments for the moment, Daru.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.03,0:13:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.11,0:13:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're shining like never before...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.37,0:13:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Makise Kurisu still there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.62,0:13:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. You were staring \Nat her back there, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.62,0:13:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what happened earlier? \NWhat's your deal with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.21,0:13:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen in the past?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.00,0:13:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing in the past, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.59,0:13:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it was the summer we were eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.72,0:13:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And on the dry riverbed of the Mississippi, \Nyour red-eared slider ran away...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.60,0:13:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It was nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.89,0:13:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw her for the first time earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.10,0:13:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you should go see the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.15,0:13:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing upstairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.40,0:14:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been shaking like an earthquake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.65,0:14:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We're performing an experiment \Nthat'll rewrite scientific history,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.99,0:14:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,but don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.28,0:14:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't do any more today...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.79,0:14:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I said stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.80,0:14:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.67,0:14:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I said stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.51,0:14:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Makise said to let her \Ndo it just one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.30,0:14:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I sent you a message. Did you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.22,0:14:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.64,0:14:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I warned you five days ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.97,0:14:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.31,0:14:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, when we weren't doing the experiments,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.35,0:14:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,your phone went off a bunch of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.77,0:14:39.27,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx81.25\fscy85\frz5.495\frx10\fry4\pos(826.5,138)} \NReally!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.77,0:14:39.27,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx81.25\fscy85\frz3.855\frx14\fry6\pos(853.5,292.5)} \NSorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.77,0:14:39.27,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\frx6\fry6\fscx81.25\fscy85\frz5.287\pos(877.5,442.5)} \NAre you maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.77,0:14:39.27,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx81.25\fscy85\frz5.802\frx4\fry2\pos(882,594)} \NHow've you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.77,0:14:39.27,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx81.25\fscy85\pos(916.5,741)\frx4\fry4\frz6.399} \N?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.77,0:14:39.27,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx81.25\fscy85\frx8\fry358\frz7.486\pos(934.5,888)} \NWell?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.27,0:14:39.40,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx81.25\fscy85\frz3.855\frx14\fry6\pos(823.5,142.5)} \NSorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.27,0:14:39.40,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\frx6\fry6\fscx81.25\fscy85\frz5.287\pos(841.5,297)} \NAre you maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.27,0:14:39.40,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx81.25\fscy85\frz5.802\frx4\fry2\pos(840,448.5)} \NHow've you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.27,0:14:39.40,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx81.25\fscy85\frx4\fry4\frz6.399\pos(874.5,597)} \N?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.27,0:14:39.40,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx81.25\fscy85\frx8\fry358\frz7.486\pos(897,750)} \NWell?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.27,0:14:39.40,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx81.25\fscy85\frz5.939\frx4\fry6\pos(928.5,889.5)} \NHey
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.40,0:14:40.78,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx81.25\fscy85\frz6.616\frx12\fry356\pos(918,297)}Hey
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.40,0:14:40.78,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx81.25\fscy85\frz7.03\pos(436.5,501)\frx2\fry0}How've you been? Okabe
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.78,0:14:41.94,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx81.25\fscy85\frz6.616\frx12\fry356\pos(918,297)}Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.78,0:14:41.94,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx81.25\fscy85\frz7.03\pos(453,561)\frx2\fry0}Find out anything about the IBN 5100 {\c&H241CBF&}?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.49,0:14:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't she just ask me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.07,0:14:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.49,0:14:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.03,0:14:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but he probably isn't getting enough calcium.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.74,0:14:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose fault is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.66,0:14:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I got plenty of data,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.20,0:14:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and I pretty much figured out the rules \Nfor how the D-Mail works.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.42,0:14:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.29,0:15:00.30,Note1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Send a modified command to the \Nmicrowave's heading function (reverse spin)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.54,0:15:01.17,Note1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Open the microwave door while heating \N(Timing -> Unconfirmed)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.09,0:15:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Each second on the timer \Nrepresents one hour back in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.67,0:15:02.42,Note1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&H595693&}Electricity
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.46,0:15:03.47,Note1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}While the electricity is sparking, \Nsend message to the phone
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.46,0:15:04.47,Note1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Prerequisites to making the electricity appear? \N(time between 12:00 PM and 18:00 PM?)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.46,0:15:05.47,Note1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Number of characters that can be sent \Nwith a D-Mail -> (12 half-width, 6 full-width) x3
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.47,0:15:06.47,Note1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}You can control the time the PhoneWave \N(name subject to change) sends a message back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.47,0:15:07.47,Note1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}One second on the timer = One hour in reality
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.05,0:15:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,One hundred twenty seconds turns into 5 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.47,0:15:08.10,Note1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}At the same time, anything placed into the \NPhoneWave becomes jelly \N(teleportation confirmed, as well)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.10,0:15:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's amazing that she figured out how to \Ncontrol how far it goes back, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.31,0:15:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But the maximum amount of information that can \Nbe sent back is 36 English characters
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.02,0:15:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,or 18 Japanese characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.81,0:15:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too small.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.15,0:15:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to fix that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.23,0:15:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you can't send anything too big
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.90,0:15:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,or send too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.65,0:15:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's that Curb black hole...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.07,0:15:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Kerr black hole, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.53,0:15:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The hole's too tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.49,0:15:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you repeat that, Mayushii?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.54,0:15:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The part about the hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.41,0:15:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.83,0:15:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, we can work out the details later,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.79,0:15:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'll say this:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.05,0:15:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,August 2, 2010,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.05,0:15:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,is a day that mankind will remember forever,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.60,0:15:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,for the Future Gadget Laboratory
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.51,0:15:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,has succeeded in developing humanity's
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.77,0:15:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,first time machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.31,0:16:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not the first one, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.52,0:16:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,SERN beat us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.61,0:16:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't "develop" it, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.11,0:16:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It was all coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.45,0:16:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you, disrespecting my great declaration...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.79,0:16:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But Okarin...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.45,0:16:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad your experiments worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.14,0:16:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.23,0:16:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.78,0:16:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Time and space have switched places here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.87,0:16:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The event horizon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.45,0:17:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't move through space,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.58,0:17:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,and time is extended forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.67,0:17:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,One second of your time \Nis an eternity to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.05,0:17:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the edge of the universe running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.80,0:17:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it, but something's expanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.93,0:17:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.97,0:17:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The universe?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.22,0:17:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.35,0:17:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You mustn't look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.89,0:17:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Eternity isn't infinite.{infinite>infinity adj>noun for that poetic feel}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.31,0:17:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if time appears to extend toward eternity,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.15,0:17:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,an end still exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.03,0:17:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,When will it be one second later?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.04,0:17:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Look forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.91,0:17:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Reach the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.17,0:17:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You mustn't turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.84,0:17:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That emailing freak again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.10,0:17:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Her persistence...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.35,0:17:58.97,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx81.25\fscy85\frx6\fry358\frz24.633\pos(931.5,93)\c&HEAEAEA&} \NYou there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.35,0:17:58.97,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx81.25\fscy85\frz24.151\frx2\fry358\pos(1005,219)\c&HF0F0F0&} \NIt's dark
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.35,0:17:58.97,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\frx6\fry6\fscx81.25\fscy85\frz22.87\pos(1075.5,336)\c&HDCDCDD&} \NWake up
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.35,0:17:58.97,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx81.25\fscy85\frx0\fry354\frz24.771\pos(1134,459)\c&HCACACB&} \NI'm here
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.35,0:17:58.97,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx81.25\fscy85\frz21.701\frx6\fry2\pos(1197,576)\c&HB8B8B8&} \NYou asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.35,0:17:58.97,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\frx6\fry2\frz24.727\pos(1269,702)\fscx77.5\fscy85\c&H8B8B8B&} \NAm I bugging you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.97,0:18:01.31,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\frz25.828\c&HC9C9CB&\fscx53.75\fscy72.5\pos(1114.5,187.5)}Am I bugging you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.97,0:18:01.31,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx81.25\fscy85\c&HD6D6D6&\frz25.197\pos(757.5,561)}Sorry for yesterday \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.60,0:18:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,"Sorry for yesterday."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.98,0:18:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,"Can I come see you?"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.94,0:18:08.69,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\frx2\fry358\frz18.234\fscx125\fscy123.75\pos(1125,118.5)\c&HE4E4E4&}I'm here
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.94,0:18:08.69,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fscx110\fscy105\frz18.589\frx2\fry358\pos(466.5,826.5)\c&HC8C8C8&}At least answer me. Or are you pretending \Nto not be there? \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.94,0:18:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't occur to you that I was asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.69,0:18:09.90,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\frx2\fry358\fscx125\fscy123.75\c&HE4E4E4&\frz19.161\pos(1123.5,112.5)}Wake up
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.69,0:18:09.90,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fscx110\fscy105\frz18.589\frx2\fry358\c&HC8C8C8&\pos(432,727.5)}Were you asleep? \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.24,0:18:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I was!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.07,0:18:15.28,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\frx6\fry6\fscx72.5\fscy76.25\frz326.103\pos(1086,420)}It's dark
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.07,0:18:15.28,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx66.25\fscy72.5\pos(750,417)\frx2\fry358\frz328.046}I'm coming up the stairs right now. \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.74,0:18:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.08,0:18:20.79,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx81.25\fscy85\frz348.207\frx6\fry2\pos(1132.5,397.5)\c&H919191&}I'm outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.08,0:18:20.79,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx77.5\fscy81.25\pos(618,531)\frx0\fry356\c&H919191&\frz348.456}I'll knock. If you're there, respond. \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.21,0:18:30.17,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx40\fscy43.75\b0\c&HCFCFCF&\pos(1035,256.5)\frz344.56\frx14\fry352}You said I could come see,\N right? \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.59,0:18:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why use your cell phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.92,0:18:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.84,0:18:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not looking at it. Just say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.18,0:18:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can show you, but I didn't think you'd come this early.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.22,0:18:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.14,0:18:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You really want to interview me, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.73,0:18:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.90,0:18:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I see... So that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.40,0:18:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're terrified of Mad Scientist \NHououin Kyouma's sinister aura!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.12,0:19:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's easier to send emails...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.62,0:19:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, show me the IBN 5100.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.54,0:19:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.67,0:19:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm just showing it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.84,0:19:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you've seen it, leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.55,0:19:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.94,0:19:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she just a retro-PC fan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.36,0:19:34.86,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx81.25\fscy85\frx4\fry358\frz356.174\pos(630,625.5)}Let me take a picture \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.86,0:19:34.90,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx81.25\fscy85\frx4\fry358\frz356.174\pos(621,705)}Let me take a picture \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.90,0:19:34.95,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx81.25\fscy85\frx4\fry358\frz356.174\pos(621,705)}Let me take a picture \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.95,0:19:34.99,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx81.25\fscy85\frx4\fry358\frz356.174\pos(621,705)}Let me take a picture \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.99,0:19:35.03,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.2\fscx81.25\fscy85\frx4\fry358\pos(606,898.5)\frz356.174}Let me take a picture \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.03,0:19:35.07,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.2\fscx81.25\fscy85\frx4\fry358\pos(606,898.5)\frz356.174}Let me take a picture \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.07,0:19:35.11,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.2\fscx81.25\fscy85\frx4\fry358\pos(606,898.5)\frz356.174}Let me take a picture \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.99,0:19:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But not my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.74,0:19:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If you photograph my face,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.41,0:19:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to silence you forever...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.16,0:19:50.00,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx81.25\fscy85\frx6\fry354\frz356.125\pos(1060.5,460.5)}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.16,0:19:50.00,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\frx2\fry358\frz356.415\fscx72.5\fscy77.5\pos(621,682.5)}I'd like you to loan it to me, okay? \NI'd be happy if you'd help me \Ncarry it. \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.79,0:19:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,"I'd like you to loan it to me, okay?"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.75,0:19:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,"I'd be happy if you'd help me carry..."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.79,0:19:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I suddenly lending it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.46,0:19:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you really want me to loan it to you, \Nthen look at me and say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.05,0:20:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you loan it to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.51,0:20:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sadly, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.77,0:20:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm only borrowing it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.40,0:20:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,When I'm done,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.35,0:20:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to return it to its original owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.86,0:20:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Its original owner?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.15,0:20:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yanabayashi Shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.78,0:20:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Guten Morgen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.70,0:20:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Miss Kiryu from yesterday, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.87,0:20:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't introduce you yesterday, did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.16,0:20:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,My favorite right arm, Supah Hakah Daru.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.92,0:20:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's "Super Hacker," man. Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.67,0:20:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I thought I'd improve \Nthe PhoneWave a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.63,0:20:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's currently a bit of a pain in the ass, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.59,0:20:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sending the D-Mails to the past, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.77,0:20:46.85,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\fscx57.5\fscy62.5\frz346.426\frx2\fry352\t(0,560,\blur2.7)\move(594,960,651,646.5,0,550)}What does he mean, \N"sending mails to the past"? \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.85,0:20:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.02,0:20:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You misheard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.23,0:20:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't say, "Sending emails to the past."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.61,0:20:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He said, "Sen Dingma Ils Tot Hepast,"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.65,0:20:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,which is ancient Sumerian for \N"Did you eat breakfast?"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.15,0:21:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Good morning, Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.66,0:21:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Can Mayushii use the time machine before you \Nto prepare the chicken?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.37,0:21:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe, I had an idea about the time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.58,0:21:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.88,0:21:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.38,0:21:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.80,0:21:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Information about #8 \Nhas been leaked to a third party.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.22,0:21:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ah, I get it. I'll do something about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.72,0:21:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.13,0:21:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Depending on the situation I'll have to seal their mouth to keep them in check.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.13,0:21:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He's totally ignoring all three of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.14,0:21:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let the Organization find out...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.72,0:21:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't email me while I'm on the phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.89,0:21:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Could that be...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.06,0:21:33.98,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx81.25\fscy85\frx10\fry350\frz323.121\pos(1005,327)}It can't be
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.06,0:21:33.98,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx81.25\fscy85\c&HDEDEDE&\pos(649.5,285)\frx6\fry340\frz325.023}It can't be FB?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.98,0:21:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,"FB"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.70,0:21:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well. I'll tell you everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.54,0:21:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you've found out,\Nthere's nothing else I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.96,0:21:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiryu Moeka,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.71,0:22:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,from now on, you're Lab Mem 005!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.24,0:22:30.29,EDRom,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8\fad(250,1500)}kisei sareta shikai mujihi naru
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.24,0:22:30.29,EDRom,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.8\\alpha&H70&\bord8.25\3c&H5E382E&\fad(250,1500)}kisei sareta shikai mujihi naru
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.24,0:22:30.29,EDTL,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8\fad(250,1500)}With my field of view restricted
